OrcaX is a modified version of Wholphin, the Android TV client for Jellyfin
created by damontecres: https://github.com/damontecres/Wholphin

Code that came from Wholphin is Copyright (C) damontecres and the Wholphin
contributors. jkrishna289 has modified it since; this repository's commit
history records those changes and their dates.

OrcaX started from Wholphin's develop branch as it stood in late May / early
June 2026, after Wholphin v0.6.2. The first commit here, dated 2026-06-27,
holds that code with its package renamed from com.github.damontecres.wholphin
to com.github.jkrishna289.orcax. Wholphin's own history was not carried over,
so `git blame` in this repository does not show who wrote the code that came
from Wholphin. Wholphin's repository does.

